 	ok(ia >= 0 and gms.find("set_voice_vol(int(Save.s(\"voice_vol\"))", ia) > ia and gms.find("sfx.mono = bool(Save.s(\"mono\"))", ia) > ia, "人聲音量與單聲道在 _apply_master 同步（開機、切單聲道都會套，Codex cat09 #1）")
